OL,3,GNEWSAWoman convicted of historic sexual
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman convicted of historic sexual
OL,7,Foffences against a teenager has been
OL,8,Fsentenced to 456 hours of community
OL,9,Fservice.
OL,11,FDonna Bentley, 53, was found guilty of
OL,12,Fthree offences ` two counts of
OL,13,Fprocuring an act of gross indecency and
OL,14,Fone of indecent assault `b@/by a trial
OL,15,Fjury in July.
OL,17,FJersey's Royal Court heard the offences
OL,18,Fwere committed in the 1990s when the
OL,19,Fvictim was under the age of 16 and
OL,20,Ftherefore unable to legally consent to
OL,21,Fsexual activity.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
